{"id":"honest","duration":67.29,"voice":"Juniper","segments":[{"t":0,"cap":"A chart is honest when the size you see matches the size in the data."},{"t":5.97,"cap":"Bars show values by their length, so a bar chart must start at zero."},{"t":12.34,"cap":"Start the axis at eleven thousand, and a season with twelve thousand fans gets a bar one unit tall, while fifteen thousand gets four units, though it is only a quarter more."},{"t":25.57,"cap":"Lines are different. A line shows values by position and slope, so it may start above zero, as long as the axis is labeled."},{"t":34.95,"cap":"The lie factor puts a number on it: the size of the effect shown, divided by the size of the effect in the data."},{"t":43.69,"cap":"Near one is honest. Enrollment grows twenty percent, the drawing grows sixty percent, and the lie factor is three."},{"t":52.24,"cap":"Two more habits. Remove ink that shows no data: 3D, heavy grids, decoration."},{"t":59.59,"cap":"And be wary of dual axes: the designer picks both scales, so any two lines can be made to move together."}],"items":[{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":0.25,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Honest: what you see = what the data say","d":1.4,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":5.97,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"bars: length shows the value","d":0.98},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":9.9,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"so start at zero","d":0.56,"color":"red"},{"k":"sketch","page":0,"t":12.34,"name":"truncBars","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[23]},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":26.95,"x":44,"y":188,"h":44,"text":"lines: position and slope","d":0.88},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":31.03,"x":78,"y":232,"h":44,"text":"may start above zero","d":0.7},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":32.41,"x":78,"y":276,"h":44,"text":"(label the axis)","d":0.56},{"k":"page","page":1,"t":34.95},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":35.2,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Lie factor","d":0.5,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":37.51,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"effect shown","d":0.5},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":39.78,"x":44,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"÷ effect in the data","d":0.7},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":43.69,"x":44,"y":188,"h":44,"text":"near 1 = honest","d":0.53,"color":"blue"},{"k":"sketch","page":1,"t":45.74,"name":"lieFactor","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[49.75]},{"k":"page","page":2,"t":52.24},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":52.49,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Two more habits","d":0.53,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":53.89,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"data-ink: remove ink","d":0.7},{"k":"hand","page":2,"t":54.67,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"that shows no data","d":0.63},{"k":"sketch","page":2,"t":52.24,"name":"dataInk","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[56.27,57.16,58.11]},{"k":"page","page":3,"t":59.59},{"k":"hand","page":3,"t":59.84,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Dual axes","d":0.5,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":3,"t":62.21,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"the designer picks","d":0.63},{"k":"hand","page":3,"t":63.25,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"both scales","d":0.5},{"k":"hand","page":3,"t":64.33,"x":44,"y":172,"h":44,"text":"any two lines 'agree'","d":0.74,"color":"blue"},{"k":"sketch","page":3,"t":60.64,"name":"dualAxes","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[62.9,64.33]}]}